config ENCORE_FAS
	tristate "Encore FAS frame telemetry (/dev/encore_fas)"
	depends on ARM64 && UPROBES
	default n
	help
	  Frame aware scheduling telemetry from Encore Tweaks
	  (rem01project/encore_fas). A uprobe on Surface::queueBuffer of the
	  foreground app times every frame and reports late frames, a low
	  frame rate and pauses to a daemon, and (Rakkashin) to avr_profile,
	  which lifts the demand-matched CPU caps that held a frame back.
